WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Dentists are not assigned like a GP: look for a practice taking NHS patients in your area (on the NHS website) and ask whether they have places.

2
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:26.000
NHS treatment has fixed prices in bands (Band 1: check-up; Band 2: fillings; Band 3: crowns and dentures). Check the current figures on the NHS website.

3
00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:42.000
It is free, for example, for under-18s, pregnant women and mothers in the last year, and some people on certain benefits (such as Universal Credit, depending on income). Severe pain at night or at the weekend: call 111.

4
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:51.500
An eye test at an optician's is free for some groups, such as children under 16.

5
00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:56.500
Say it aloud: “I have toothache.”.
